Output "examples/display/matrix.gif"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 640
Set Theme '{ "name": "demo", "background": "#000000", "foreground": "#dddddd", "cursor": "#dddddd", "selection": "#dddddd" }'
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
# Generated by tape.ml: the build in matrix, its table's frame moving.
Require "dune"
Hide
Type "dune build examples/display/main.exe && clear"
Enter
Wait@300000ms
Show
Type "dune exec examples/display/main.exe matrix"
Enter
Wait+Screen@60000ms /build complete/
Sleep 2000ms
